Key Features
Pagination: Default 20 items per page, maximum 100 to prevent abuse
JSONB Storage: Full AnalysisResult stored as JSON for flexibility
Optimized Queries: Indexes on userId + createdAt DESC and repoFullName
Empty States: Graceful UI for users with no analyses
Responsive Design: Mobile-first approach with Tailwind CSS
