Verification & Testing
Phase 2.1 Verification
Database Setup:


# Verify database connection
npx prisma studio

# Check migrations
npx prisma migrate status
Token Encryption Test:


node -e "
const { encryptToken, decryptToken } = require('./lib/auth/encryption.ts');
const test = 'gho_test_token_1234567890';
const enc = encryptToken(test);
const dec = decryptToken(enc);
console.log('Encryption works:', test === dec);
"
OAuth Flow Test (Manual):

Start dev server: npm run dev
Navigate to http://localhost:3000
Click "Sign in with GitHub"
Authorize the app
Verify in Prisma Studio:
User record exists
githubTokenEncrypted field is populated
Session record exists
Private Repo Test:

Sign in with GitHub
Analyze a private repository URL
Verify analysis completes successfully
Sign out
Try analyzing same private repo
Verify it fails with "Repository not found" (confirms token-based access)
Phase 2.2 Verification
Database Save Test:

Sign in
Analyze 3-5 public repositories
Check Prisma Studio for Analysis records
Verify result JSONB field contains full AnalysisResult
History API Test:


# With session cookie
curl -X GET http://localhost:3000/api/history?page=1&limit=20 \
  -H "Cookie: next-auth.session-token=<your-session-token>"
History UI Test (Manual):

Analyze 5+ repositories (to test pagination)
Navigate to /history
Verify all analyses appear in reverse chronological order
Test pagination controls (if > 20 analyses)
