Rollback Plan
If Database Issues Occur

# Reset database to previous migration
npx prisma migrate reset

# Or rollback to specific migration
npx prisma migrate resolve --rolled-back <migration-name>
If OAuth Issues Occur
Disable authentication checks temporarily
Fallback to anonymous mode
Add feature flag: ENABLE_AUTH=false in .env.local
Feature Flag Implementation

const AUTH_ENABLED = process.env.ENABLE_AUTH !== "false";

if (!AUTH_ENABLED) {
  // Use Phase 1 code paths
  return getDefaultOctokit();
}
